  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<strong> <em>「從前，有一位玩家。<br> 那位玩家就是你。」</em></strong>\n\n<br><br>\nPixels Reforged 是一款貼圖包，在忠於遊戲原始風格的同時，為 Minecraft 的視覺風格注入全新活力。我們的目標不是改變 Minecraft 的獨特之處，而是溫和且細膩地強化某些視覺元素，讓整個世界感覺更加生動且充滿沉浸感。\n<br><br>\n本項目計畫定期更新，並支援未來的 Minecraft 版本。現在，請隨意瀏覽圖庫，體驗等待你的全新感受。\n<br><br>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fpixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fshadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSPixelforg42358\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c203e34d55c180c9d485d83649fe2e030a8af378.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"NO DEPENDENCIES REQUIRED\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<strong> 此資料包完全相容於原版 Minecraft - 無需額外模組！</strong>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe1219667e03dc5a8a0d38d9a353c89ee06fd529.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"MORE INTERESTING PROJECTS\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:center\"> \n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-night-of-the-living-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"The Night of the <br> Living Pumpkins icon\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/railbalance\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3a7175ae8324de3de9cbfd3c3032780e5c9779a_0.webp\" alt=\"Railbalance Icon\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-pixels-reforged-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/543bdae3a809c8f18421b8c685cb5acf2ee52502.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Pixels Reforged Edition Icon\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52a9136709049f32137c8ac3c85fffe3bfb4b011.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"YOUR SUPPORT MAKES THE DIFFERENCE\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果你喜歡我創作的內容，歡迎加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi，享受所有會員專屬內容。你將能獲得許多額外福利，例如進行中的作品、幕後製作、開發日誌等更多精彩內容！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"join ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"join patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"></a> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47c5c5afc293799c37a2ebe57bf66a77a5fa49ae.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"FAQs\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</h4><p><br>\n以下留下了一些你可能會有的疑問解答，希望對你有幫助。</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<h4><strong> Q: Shadow's Pixels Reforged 是模組／模組包／資料包／插件嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- A: 不，Shadow's Pixels Reforged 只是一個材質包，完全不需要任何依賴，只需原版 Minecraft！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> Q: 你會製作 Bedrock 版本嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- A: 要製作能在 Bedrock 上運行的版本，我們需要了解 Bedrock 的運作方式。遺憾的是，我們目前短期內沒有計劃，但未來終究會推出的。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> Q: 你會製作模組嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- A: 我們目前正在開發全新的模組，請在 Ko-fi 或 Patreon 上支持我們，即可第一時間了解相關消息！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> Q: 1.0 之後的計畫是什麼？ </strong></h4>\n- A: 我們計畫繼續更新此材質包，並加入許多新功能，這些功能將在 2.0 更新中推出。如果想了解更多即將推出的內容，請參閱這篇部落格文章，我們詳細介紹了所有即將到來的內容！\n<br><br>\n西班牙文部落格：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpost%252fSpanish-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-D1D41FDF1B\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/post/Spanish-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-D1D41FDF1B</a>\n<br>\n英文部落格：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpost%252fEnglish-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-E1E21FN39I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/post/English-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-E1E21FN39I</a>\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> Q: 我可以將你的資料包放入我的模組包中嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- A: 可以，只要標註來源即可。\n<br><br><br>\n</div>",
